---
title: "governance::verify_vaa (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: state::assert_latest_only(pyth_state)
    q_version --> q_source: vaa_data_source = data_source::new(vaa_chain, vaa_address)
    q_source --> q_check: is_valid_governance_data_source(pyth_state, vaa_data_source)
    q_check --> q_abort: false, abort E_INVALID_GOVERNANCE_DATA_SOURCE
    q_check --> q_extract: true
    q_extract --> q_digest: digest = vaa::digest(verified_vaa)
    q_digest --> q_seq: sequence = vaa::sequence(verified_vaa)
    q_seq --> q_payload: payload = vaa::take_payload(verified_vaa)
    q_payload --> [*]: return WormholeVAAVerificationReceipt(payload, digest, sequence)

    note right of q_check
        INV-001: VAA emitter must match governance data source (chain + address)
        INV-002: receipt is a non-storable struct (must be used in same txn)
        INV-003: only latest contract version may verify governance VAAs
    end note
